  "body": "This is a super trivial thing I noticed while reading the sync C-S API docs.\r\n\r\n> since | string | A point in time to continue a sync from.\r\n\r\nIn my opinion this would be much more valuable if it said it should be a token from the `next_batch` key in the response or something. My first thought when reading this was that it wanted a timestamp of some kind.",
